~ start
if not facts.rosh_swapped_masks.known
	set facts.rosh_swapped_masks.known = true
	Roch the Twin: O-Oh, hey! It's me Roch! I-I'm not Wensley! 
	Roch the Twin: I mean I'm not the butler! 
	Roch the Twin: ...Sorry, I'm not really feeling myself right now.  It's nice to see a new face! or uh, a new mask! Everyone here is really friendly b-but you shouldn't trust them too much, I never did. 
	Roch the Twin: S-sorry if I'm acting strange, we got some tough news earlier. Thats why I'm hiding out in the kitchen right now while wearing the butlers mask, w-with Wensleys permission of course!. W-we as in my twin and I, his name is Ford. Have you met him yet? 
	Roch the Twin: Maybe it's best you don't tonight, last I saw him he was going for all the hard cheese. I hope he doesn't get too messy this time...He can be a lot but he means well! 
	Roch the Twin: A-anyways.... I'm just going to stay in here for tonight. Don't let me keep you... 
elif not facts.rosh_stilton_knife.known
	set facts.rosh_stilton_knife.known = true
	Roch the Twin: AAH! Please don't shout at me!! 
	Roch the Twin: Oh it's y-you! Sorry! I thought you were Stilton. He was in here earlier and was really intense, he said some strange things thinking I was Wensley since I'm wearing his mask. 
	Roch the Twin: Like, interrogating me! I didn't know what to say at all I couldn't even look at him I was so scared. 
	Roch the Twin: It's too chaotic in there...but the chaos found me anyways.. I really don't want to join the party right now... 
	Roch the Twin: Sorry, did you need something? I don't really know my way around here. You need a cheese knife or something? Stilton was looking for one, but they're all out. If you need one maybe you check the cabinet or find one out in the party? 
	Roch the Twin: If you find Wensley he could tell you, he knows where everything is in Cheese Manor.
=> END
